From 60cb822f0922e72d9fec2c4dcaf61a55c0843578 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Shammah Chancellor <shammah.chancellor@notvalid.com>
Date: Fri, 16 Oct 2026 19:18:11 -0700
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] perf(lotus_v2): eliminate O(B*M log U) batch & snapshot
 bottlenecks + add TPS benchmarks

Optimizations touching newly built Lotus V2 systems (annotated to roll into
their respective original patches in the slice stack):

- [Rolls into Patch 020] UtxoOverlayArena & MempoolOverlayLayer
  (src/lotus_v2/mempool_overlay.{h,cpp}, src/txmempool.{h,cpp}):
  * Eliminate duplicate SmtInsert/SmtErase tree walks and BLAKE3 hashing on
    every UtxoOverlayArena::InsertCoin and EraseOutpoint; lazily materialize
    current_smt_root_ via ExportSmtNode(root_idx_) in GetSmtRoot() with zero
    BLAKE3 re-hashing (1.95x MerklixOverlayManager::AddTransaction speedup).
  * Replace std::map<Outpoint, ...> in MempoolOverlayLayer with
    std::unordered_map<Outpoint, ..., OutpointHasher> for O(1) lookups.
  * Fast-path CTxMemPool::SyncMerklixOverlayToTip when already anchored at
    the active tip to avoid redundant GetV2BlockStateSnapshot mutex locks.

- [Rolls into Patch 035] Lock-Free RCU SnapshotPublisher & Mining Template
  (src/node/snapshot.{h,cpp}, src/txmempool.{h,cpp}, src/primitives/block.{h,cpp}):
  * Add CTxMemPool::ScopedSnapshotDefer RAII guard to coalesce N per-tx
    PublishMempoolSnapshot rebuilds during batch operations into a single
    snapshot publication on scope exit.
  * Add lightweight PublishMempoolUnbroadcastSnapshot for AddUnbroadcastTx
    and RemoveUnbroadcastTx so P2P inv trickle updates unbroadcast state in
    O(log M) without rebuilding the mining template or Merklix roots.
  * Reuse pre-serialized tx_hex and unchanged MempoolEntrySnapshot records
    across snapshots via O(M) merge-scan over TxId-sorted vectors.
  * Extract subtree_a_root and utxo_root in O(1) directly from
    MerklixOverlayManager in PopulateMiningTemplate instead of recomputing
    TransactionSubtreeARoot and BuildV2TemplateBaseState from scratch.

- [Rolls into Patch 034 / Patch 036] Batch Validation & ConnectBlock Ordering
  (src/validation.{h,cpp}, src/rpc/mempool.cpp):
  * Add ProcessRawTxBatch two-phase all-or-nothing batch validation and
    commit under a single ScopedSnapshotDefer in submitrawtxbatch, raising
    MAX_RAWTX_BATCH_COUNT to 1,000 and MAX_RAWTX_BATCH_SIZE_KB to 10,000.
  * Reorder ConnectTip so m_mempool->ConnectBlockReset runs after
    disconnectpool.removeForBlock, eliminating O(K*M) ReanchorExistingTxs
    rebuilds for transactions confirmed in the connected block.

- Add v2_kernel_throughput_benchmark (src/test/lotus_v2_tests.cpp) and 3-node
  loopback TPS stress suite (test/functional/lotus_v2_loopback_tps_stress.py).
